  "description": "As a professional womanizer and scam artist, Pilju has been hustling in the city’s nightlife for years. But when an attempt to leech off a gangster’s girlfriend goes sideways, he returns to his hometown to lay low. However, the one thing he didn’t expect was running straight into Jin Ae-gyeom. \n\nThe last time Pilju saw him, Ae-gyeom was a sweet little kid. Spoiled? Sure. Obsessive and borderline creepy? Definitely—but still harmless and cute as a button. Now, he’s a wealthy, handsome young physician and the easiest target Pilju’s ever seen. But behind Ae-gyeom’s bashful smiles and devoted eyes, something just doesn’t sit right. \n\nAe-gyeom hasn't just been waiting for Pilju to return—he's been obsessively calculating this reunion for years. And he is willing to do anything to keep Pilju by his side forever.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
